+### KHMER SYSTEM KHQR gateway
+
+Each shop can select **KHMER SYSTEM** in Shop Dashboard -> Payment Settings and
+save its merchant `sk_live_...` secret key. The server calls the official
+`https://pay.khmer-system.com` API to generate a unique QR, poll payment status,
+and confirm the credit after the order is marked paid. The provider requires the
+paying customer to have signed in with Telegram because its API uses that
+customer's numeric Telegram ID for each transaction. Never put the secret key in
+frontend environment variables or client-side code.
+
 ### Security Features Built In
 - bcrypt password hashing
 - JWT bearer tokens with expiration
